Package: mdir-u
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jtlsun Chois
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, xdg-utils, poppler-utils, nano
Homepage: https://github.com/jtl-sun/mdir-u
Description: Fast dual-pane terminal file manager
 mDIR-U provides keyboard- and mouse-friendly file management, previews,
 safe background file operations, search, archives, and batch rename tools.

